"Vandy Carisson is an S-rank Sky Shaper in Alden Thorn's CNH hero class."
"She has brown hair and blue-gray eyes and wears the full school uniform daily."
"She practices refined shaping by steering paper airplanes."
"Her parents are heroes; her mother serves in residence at Matadero during demon fights."
"A hundred thousand followers once watched her watch recordings of her parents at work."
"At CNH she rooms with Maricel and Tuyet."
"She is always practicing, and checks Alden's pockets to spot when his skill is on."
"She offered to teach Alden wordchains, and dislikes Lute."
"She was Lute's classmate at Nilama Paragon; she loves rules, and her parents are famous S-ranks."
